# Read by the branch-safety scan (workaholic:release-scan) as :(exclude) globs.
# This is a pre-declaration made in review, not an override: the file is
# committed, so every entry lands in a diff a human reads, and secret findings
# stay non-overridable everywhere else.
#
# Keep every entry as narrow as the file it excuses, and only after trying to
# fix the finding at its source. A directory glob here would silently cover the
# next file added beside it, and a PRODUCTION file listed here means a real key
# hardcoded in it later goes unreported.

