# The GCP OAuth spec. It exercises the RFC 7523 token exchange, so it must
# contain the response vocabulary -- `access_token`, `token_type`, `Bearer` --
# with values beside it, which is a credential shape by construction. The
# values are stubs (`stub-access-token`); the RSA key pair the spec signs with
# is GENERATED FRESH at run time by `node:crypto` and is deliberately not
# committed, so this file holds no key material at all.
#
